    {
      "id": "locations",
      "title": "Locations",
      "anchor": "Locations",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "These can be done in any order without <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lex</a> needing to provide each hint."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "label": "Plushie · Hint",
          "head": [
            "Plushie",
            "Hint",
            "Location",
            "Map"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mr_Bitey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Mr_Bitey.png?a67eb\" alt=\"Mr Bitey.png: RS3 Inventory image of Mr Bitey\" width=\"28\" height=\"31\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mr_Bitey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mr Bitey</a>",
              "Ummm, I think I might have lost a plushie in a prison cell.",
              "On the 2<sup>nd</sup> floor (UK) / 3<sup>rd</sup> floor (US) of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Paterdomus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Paterdomus</a>, in a bed behind the bars.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Count_Snugula\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Count_Snugula.png?8a565\" alt=\"Count Snugula.png: RS3 Inventory image of Count Snugula\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Count_Snugula\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Count Snugula</a>",
              "Umm, I might have dropped one in a hidden library somewhere.",
              "Under the Paterdomus, climb down the trapdoor near <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drezel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drezel</a> or Ivan Strom. The plushie is on the top shelf of a book shelf.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fangs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Fangs.png?1ae7b\" alt=\"Fangs.png: RS3 Inventory image of Fangs\" width=\"26\" height=\"29\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fangs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fangs</a>",
              "Umm, I&#39;m sure I lost one deep in the Haunted Woods.",
              "South-west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fairy ring</a> (code <b>A</b><b>L</b><b>Q</b>) in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Haunted_Woods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Haunted Woods</a>, being held by a skeleton.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Draccles_(The_Lost_Toys)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Draccles.png?32e25\" alt=\"Draccles.png: RS3 Inventory image of Draccles (The Lost Toys)\" width=\"24\" height=\"29\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Draccles_(The_Lost_Toys)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Draccles</a>",
              "Umm, there was a tomb nearby when I lost the next one.",
              "On a rock near Ivandis Seergaze&#39;s tomb in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Meiyerditch_Laboratories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meiyerditch Laboratories</a>. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fairy ring</a> (code <b>D</b><b>L</b><b>S</b>), then through three cave entrances: south, north, then north-east. Furthest cave entrance north, just south of searchable wall.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mr_Puddles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Mr_Puddles.png?32e25\" alt=\"Mr Puddles.png: RS3 Inventory image of Mr Puddles\" width=\"26\" height=\"29\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mr_Puddles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mr Puddles</a>",
              "Ooh yuck - that place with the spiders. I ran away fast!",
              "Inside the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Araxyte_Hive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Araxyte Hive</a>, near the entrance to the fight with <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Araxxor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Araxxor</a>.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Drakemon.png?32e25\" alt=\"Drakemon.png: RS3 Inventory image of Drakemon\" width=\"26\" height=\"27\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakemon</a>",
              "Umm, the next one I lost was near a tree with a big hole in it.",
              "In <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Hollows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Hollows</a>, in a group of mushrooms just south of the entrance to the caves, east of the large tree near <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Curpile_Fyod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Curpile Fyod</a>. Nearest teleport is <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Canifis_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Canifis lodestone</a>.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blushie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Blushie.png?8cb27\" alt=\"Blushie.png: RS3 Inventory image of Blushie\" width=\"26\" height=\"29\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blushie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blushie</a>",
              "Umm, I think I lost one in a secret hideout.",
              "On a chair in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Myreque_Hideout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Myreque Hideout</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Burgh_de_Rott\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Burgh de Rott</a>. Climb down the trapdoor at the The Dilapidated pub. Teleport to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Burgh_de_Rott\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Burgh de Rott</a> using <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakan%27s_medallion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakan&#39;s medallion</a>.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vamplushie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Vamplushie.png?8a565\" alt=\"Vamplushie.png: RS3 Inventory image of Vamplushie\" width=\"26\" height=\"27\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vamplushie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vamplushie</a>",
              "Umm, I remember being in a mine one time.",
              "In a broken minecart in the south-west corner of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Meiyerditch_mine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meiyerditch mine</a>. Teleport to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Darkmeyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Darkmeyer</a> using <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakan%27s_Medallion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakan&#39;s Medallion</a> then enter <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Castle_Drakan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Castle Drakan</a>&#39;s refinery and push the minecart in the south-eastern tunnel to travel to the mine.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Heartless\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Heartless.png?9dbba\" alt=\"Heartless.png: RS3 Inventory image of Heartless\" width=\"26\" height=\"29\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Heartless\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Heartless</a>",
              "Umm, I lost one in an underground laboratory somewhere.",
              "In a broken range in the normal bloodveld chamber in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Meiyerditch_laboratory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meiyerditch laboratory</a>. Teleport to Meiyerditch laboratory using <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakan%27s_Medallion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakan&#39;s Medallion</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blood_altar_teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blood altar teleport</a>.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/My_Little_Vanstrom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/My_Little_Vanstrom.png?8a565\" alt=\"My Little Vanstrom.png: RS3 Inventory image of My Little Vanstrom\" width=\"24\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/My_Little_Vanstrom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">My Little Vanstrom</a>",
              "Umm, there was loads of blood near where I lost the last one!",
              "In a coffin, just west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blood_altar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blood altar</a>. If you just picked up Heartless, just click the area to the north and it&#39;s right there. Otherwise, the nearest teleport is the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blood_altar_teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blood altar teleport</a>.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vlad_the_Embracer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Vlad_the_Embracer.png?9dbba\" alt=\"Vlad the Embracer.png: RS3 Inventory image of Vlad the Embracer\" width=\"26\" height=\"29\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vlad_the_Embracer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vlad the Embracer</a>",
              "Umm, there was a carpeted cave I remember - I might have lost one there.",
              "Sitting on the edge of the blood pool in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakan</a>&#39;s tomb under Burgh de Rott. Partial completion of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Branches_of_Darkmeyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Branches of Darkmeyer</a> required. Teleport to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Burgh_de_Rott\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Burgh de Rott</a> using <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakan%27s_medallion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakan&#39;s medallion</a>, and enter the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cave_entrance_(Burgh_de_Rott)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cave entrance</a>.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Booboo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Booboo.png?9dbba\" alt=\"Booboo.png: RS3 Inventory image of Booboo\" width=\"26\" height=\"29\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Booboo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booboo</a>",
              "Umm, I lost one in a graveyard, I think.",
              "In a swamp tree just west of the mausoleum in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Icyene_graveyard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Icyene graveyard</a>. If the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Lord_of_Vampyrium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Lord of Vampyrium</a> quest has been started, teleport to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Burgh_de_Rott\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Burgh de Rott</a> using <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Drakan%27s_medallion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakan&#39;s medallion</a> and board the boat on the south shore. If not, go to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Everlight_Dig_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Everlight Dig Site</a> and use the south shortcut to hop down to the graveyard.",
              ""
            ],
            [
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scare_Bear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://runescape.wiki/images/Scare_Bear.png?a9efc\" alt=\"Scare Bear.png: RS3 Inventory image of Scare Bear\" width=\"25\" height=\"27\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a>",
              "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scare_Bear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Scare Bear</a>",
              "Umm, the next one I lost on a wall somewhere.",
              "At the very end of the top of the wall around <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Darkmeyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Darkmeyer</a>, north of Drakan&#39;s castle, just east of the north sketch location for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Darkness_of_Hallowvale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Darkness of Hallowvale</a>. Take the boat from Burgh de Rott to Meiyerditch and travel north along the wall to reach the wall around Darkmeyer. <br>Go north until you reach a ladder, climb down it and search the wall on the east and the open the barricade in the northern wall. Climb up the next ladder, then climb up the next ladder again, and climb down the next ladder, and run north to the ladder just on the south of the castle Drakan. Climb the ladder, then follow the wall around until you find the plushie.",
              ""
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
